At Fri, 25 Apr 2008 13:24:21 +0530,
Harsha priya gupta wrote:
> 
> aplay works. But real player still gives me the error. What is the reason?

Normally apps open the PCM with name "default".  And, for intel8x0,
dmix is used for default PCM.  The dmix plugin requires mmap
explicitly.

You can write the following in ~/.asoundrc to override the default,

pcm.!default "hw:0"


